			"reflection": {
				"verdant": "The key opens no lock. Eli keeps it anyway, because every repaired corner now answers when he calls this place home.",
				"ashen": "The key is blackened and warm. The Hideaway holds against the cinders, and Morrow finally sleeps with both ears down."
